{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026K1NElbeAeE1793199659.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>維也納網球公開賽，艾卡拉斯晉級次圈。</p><p></p><p>黃色褲的艾卡拉斯面對卡贊諾夫，世界第3對24位，雖然首盤先失守，但艾卡拉斯回敬兩次破發，反勝6-4。</p><p></p><p>過去六次交手艾卡拉斯全勝，這位23歲西班牙球手保持對戰連勝走勢，第二盤再贏「細分」7-5，直落兩盤晉級次圈。</p><p></p><p>面向鏡頭的頭號種子施華利夫，打足三盤擊敗蘭達路斯，其中決勝盤，激戰超過1個半小時，贏「細分」13-11。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:14.224620+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T15:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T18:58:11.413576+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:55:39.761906+00:00","content_hash":"6141e95ec439b54ce3c364a1619d18bd00a5d5ba33d5f0f7f78f2da6daf35580","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:14.224620+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}